{"unit_id":"JerryLingWuQ__dsh-traffic-guard#card-zh","repo":"JerryLingWuQ/dsh-traffic-guard","commit":"007e0d71329646969941a557ea1692a601c0bf24","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-traffic-guard 是一个为 DSH 注册下载与网络流量工具的插件。它先尝试直连，仅对配置允许且直连停滞的主机升级到本地 HTTP 代理，并按调用和每日用量限制代理流量。用户可以先探测 URL 的直连状态，再下载文件并查看流量摘要；重定向的每一跳都会重新判断路由。调用记录包含 URL、主机、路由和字节数，汇总保存在本机账本中。适合使用计量代理、希望追踪下载开销的 DSH 用户；需要 Python 和可选的本地 HTTP 代理，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:100-180","cli/netguard.py:383-457","cli/netguard.py:531-535","cli/netguard.py:552-568"]}
{"unit_id":"JerryLingWuQ__dsh-traffic-guard#card-en","repo":"JerryLingWuQ/dsh-traffic-guard","commit":"007e0d71329646969941a557ea1692a601c0bf24","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-traffic-guard adds DSH tools to probe and download URLs, using direct access first and a local proxy only when configured hosts stall. Per-call and daily limits cap proxied bytes; redirects are rechecked and calls are recorded in a local traffic ledger. Requires Python; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:100-180","cli/netguard.py:383-457","cli/netguard.py:531-535","cli/netguard.py:552-568"]}
