{"unit_id":"JerryLingWuQ__dsh-traffic-guard#feature-1","repo":"JerryLingWuQ/dsh-traffic-guard","commit":"007e0d71329646969941a557ea1692a601c0bf24","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-traffic-guard 的功能「受预算约束的下载」：通过 net_download 获取 URL 文件，先尝试直连；允许代理的主机在直连停滞时才升级到本地代理，并对代理流量执行单次和每日上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:146-180","cli/netguard.py:383-457","cli/netguard.py:514-549"]}
