{"unit_id":"JerryLingWuQ__dsh-traffic-guard#caveat-1","repo":"JerryLingWuQ/dsh-traffic-guard","commit":"007e0d71329646969941a557ea1692a601c0bf24","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-traffic-guard 使用前须知：下载请求会发送到用户提供的 URL，并可能经配置的本机 HTTP 代理转发；每次调用的 URL、主机、路由和字节数保存在本机 JSONL 账本中。插件不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cli/netguard.py:383-421","cli/netguard.py:531-535","cli/netguard.py:38-40"]}
